        "https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man8/lvmdevices.8.html",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lvmteam/lvm2/main/lib/filters/filter-regex.c"
      ],
      "simplifications": "Read-only in-process virtual inventories; no host LVM, devices or files. Supports one explicit devices section, use_devicesfile 0/1 and 1–8 bounded filter rules. The devices-file table models devname membership only, not real hardware IDs, PVIDs or serialization. No aliases, sysfs, udev, global_filter, config overrides, implicit defaults, activation or provisioning. These two authored tasks provide partial practice, not complete objective or real-equipment coverage. Sources checked2026-11-07.",
